{"id":"vod_bf_13716","vodId":"13716","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"花开伊吕波","name_cn":"花开伊吕波","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-14/647d3d95d4c4d1157c4f5d3a128b2d4e.jpg"},"summary":"16岁的少女松前绪花（伊藤かな恵 配音）是一个自由生活在东京的普通女高中生。一如这座虽则繁华却死板枯燥的大都市，她的生活平淡无味。正处在幻想的年纪，绪花时刻期盼着“突然的夜奔、突然的爱恋、突然的离别”这类事情的发生。某天，她期盼的已久的时刻终于到来。因偶然的机缘，绪花来到了外婆（久保田民絵 配音）经营的温泉旅馆喜翠庄。在这个位于石川县的偏远所在，时光仿佛凝滞了一般，依然保留着大正时代浓浓的古意。绪花以员工的身份留在喜翠庄，终日努力工作，也结识了和她年龄相仿的女孩子以及形色各异的住客。在这里，她似乎找到了新的生活方向……　　本片为P.A.Works公司成立十周年原创纪念作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:08:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huakaiyilvbo/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name"